   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "59cdae9f-8dbe-45f9-a03f-169d2998c6bf"],
 " is replaced by list of defined grades."
}], "Notes",
