Cell["\<\
If few orderings for the same algebra are defined, then short references  may \
overwrite each other. Therefore, it is recommended to use the detailed form.\
\>", "Text",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953882932770668*^9, 3.953883015883212*^9}, {
   3.953883077580084*^9, 3.953883147660174*^9}, 3.9538832572689466`*^9, {
