 CellID->1949424697,ExpressionUUID->"783bceb0-6e11-4d62-9863-a291c01a1e26"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The option \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]DefineInput\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
specify if input aliases should be in addition defined. The input aliases \
allows convenient input of basis elements by hand (this is default).  The \
option \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MakeAlias\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] specify if \
the defined basis should be assigned to ",
 ButtonBox["gaOrthonormalBasis[\[MediumSpace]]",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{"gaOrthonormalBasis.nb", None},
  ButtonNote->"gaOrthonormalBasis"],
 StyleBox["\[MediumSpace]", "InlineSeparator"],
 " container for further reference. The option \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]DefineField\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] in addition \
defines noncommutative field. This option is only used when defining basis \
for noncommutative field and should never be set to False when defining basis \
for geometric algebras."
}], "Text",
 Editable->True,
